{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827703970725941","content":"Resistant. While under the effects of Rutgut’s purified grease,  you have resistance to fire. You are immune to the Prone Condition.\nAmorphous. As an action, you can speak a command word and cause your body to assume the amorphous qualities of living congealed fat. For one minute, you (along with any equipment you’re wearing or carrying) can move through a space as narrow as 1 inch wide without squeezing. Once you use this property, it may only be used once.\nBoiling  Breath. As an action, you can exhale scalding grease in a 30-foot line that is 5 feet wide. Each creature in that line must make a DC 15 Dexterity saving throw, taking 36 (8d8) fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. Once you use this property, it can’t be used again until the next dawn. This weapon does not ignite flammable objects.\nSymbiotic Nature. The grease can’t be removed from you while you’re attuned to it, and you can’t voluntarily end your attunement to it. If you’re targeted by a spell that ends a curse (or other dispelling effect), it seeps out of you.\nIf you die while the grease is inside you, it bursts out and engulfs you, turning your corpse into a black pudding","created_at":"2020-08-09T03:33:34.875000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-09T03:34:41.815000Z","id":"741861710364934266","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
